      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C5%9Awi%C4%99tokrzyskie_Voivodeship"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Kielce Cathedral is listed among the ten Historic Monuments of Poland in the voivodeship.",
